        Evaluating Skills, Not Just <span class="search-hit mathjax">Agents</span>: <span class="search-hit mathjax">Agentic</span> Continuous Evaluation of Skills
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Kevin%2C+C">Christopher Kevin</a>, 
      
