        <span>&nbsp;[<a href="https://arxiv.org/pdf/2602.13291">pdf</a>, <a href="https://arxiv.org/ps/2602.13291">ps</a>, <a href="https://arxiv.org/format/2602.13291">other</a>]&nbsp;</span>
